                    Drafted by W.Y Smith.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d263-f2" n="2" xml:id="d263-f2-content">
                <p>Reference is to Edwin M. Martin, Assistant Secretary of State for Inter-American
                    Affairs, and his statement written for and published in the New York Herald
                    Tribune, October 6, 1963. The statement is also printed in Department of State
                    Bulletin, November 4, 1963, pp. 698-704.</p>
            </note>
